flowchart LR
  Source[Commit and dirty-state check] --> Harness[Qualification harness]
  Env[OS, kernel, filesystem, browser, hardware] --> Harness
  Harness --> Tests[Mandatory profile tests]
  Tests --> Bundle[Signed manifest, logs, hashes, results]
  Bundle --> Gate{All mandatory checks pass?}
  Gate -->|yes| Claim[Profile-specific qualified result]
  Gate -->|no or unavailable| Unqualified[Remain unqualified]
